  "fullDescription": "Amour Christmas is a festive and elegant display serif font designed to add joyful charm to your holiday creations.\n\nFeaturing whimsical swashes, playful ornaments, and a luxurious serif base, this typeface is perfect for Christmas cards, branding, social media posts, and seasonal packaging. Its unique blend of classic elegance and cheerful flair makes every message feel magical and full of holiday spirit.\n\nThe Amour Christmas font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.",
